  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Public Sector Financial Management Program</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The program is designed to improve the Government of Samoa&apos;s (government) capacity in public financial management and to strengthen the country&apos;s resilience to external shocks by supporting the government&apos;s medium-term fiscal framework (MTFF) and the joint policy action matrix (JPAM) on public financial management policies and processes, developed by the government and its development partners.</narrative>
  </description>
